  "description": "Are you annoyed by blind spots while driving?\nAre you worried about accidents when towing?\nYou MUST have extendable towing mirrors to DRIVE SAFELY.\nFitment\n2014-2018 Chevy Silverado 1500\n2015-2018 Chevy Silverado 2500 HD\n2015-2018 Chevy Silverado 3500 HD\n2014-2018 GMC Sierra 1500\n2015-2018 GMC Sierra 2500 HD\n2015-2018 GMC Sierra 3500 HD\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nSupported models: vertical trailer tow mirrors are compatible with 2014-2018 Chevy Silverado / GMC Sierra 1500; 2015-2018 Chevy Silverado / GMC Sierra 2500HD / 3500HD\nTelescoping & turn signal: unlike non-adjustable mirrors, these trailer tow mirrors effectively extend a line of sight to provide a larger viewing area; and the turn signal makes it easy to spot to increase safety when turning or changing lanes\nPower heated: this plane mirror can remove the frost and mist to keep it clear when driving in rain and snowfall weather\nPrecise fit: these outside rearview mirrors are precisely designed, very quick, and easy to install; sold as a pair, including LH (driver side) & RH (passenger side)\nNote: if your vehicle doesn't have the listed functions(such as turn signal), it might not function well; please disable the memory function on D.I.C if your vehicle with memory mirror module; professional installation would be highly recommended",
